s/2/labels","id":6044960,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjA0NDk2MA==","number":2,"title":"1.0","description":"stuff we need to nail down before launch","creator":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":628,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-10-29T01:17:50Z","updated_at":"2022-12-19T11:47:29Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2022-12-19T11:47:29Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2021-04-12T04:38:41Z","updated_at":"2021-04-16T15:46:11Z","closed_at":"2021-04-16T15:46:11Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nThere is a hidden element on the page with id `svelte-announcer` that is used for accessibility. When developing (running `svelte-kit dev`) the element is hidden.  However, once you run `svelte-kit build && node build` the element becomes visible as soon as you make a client side navigation. \r\n\r\n**Logs**\r\nNo browser or server errors occur\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n1. Check out this repo: https://github.com/trentjones21/svelte-bug . It is just the default svelte kit template with a second route added for navigation.\r\n2. `npm run dev`\r\n3. Click the \"Client side navigation\" link, and notice there is no issue\r\n4. `npm run build && node build`\r\n5. Click the \"Client side navigation\" link.  Notice that the \"Navigated to ...\" accessibility text is visible on the screen\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\"Navigated to ...\" text shouldn't be visible \r\n\r\n**Information about your SvelteKit Installation:**\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>Diagnostics</summary>\r\n\r\n-   System:\r\n    OS: macOS 11.2.2\r\n    CPU: (8) x64 Apple M1\r\n    Memory: 217.55 MB / 16.00 GB\r\n    Shell: 5.8 - /bin/zsh\r\n  Binaries:\r\n    Node: 14.15.4 - /usr/local/bin/node\r\n    npm: 7.5.4 - /usr/local/bin/npm\r\n  Browsers:\r\n    Chrome: 89.0.4389.114\r\n    Firefox: 87.0\r\n    Safari: 14.0.3\r\n  npmPackages:\r\n    @sveltejs/kit: next => 1.0.0-next.72 \r\n    svelte: ^3.29.0 => 3.37.0 \r\n    vite: ^2.1.0 => 2.1.5 \r\n\r\n\r\n- Browser I used: `Safari: 14.0.3`\r\n\r\n- Bug exists in `adapter-node` and `adapter-netlify`.  Those are the only two I tested. \r\n</details>\r\n\r\n**Severity**\r\nSerious enough that it makes it hard to deploy a site as long as this bug exists\r\n\r\n**Screenshot of the bug**\r\n<img width=\"244\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-04-11 at 10 37 17 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5697561/114341260-92d5c100-9b16-11eb-8039-538eb102968a.png\">\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_use